  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "二次審査……通らなかったよ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そっかー\r\n三峰、割と頑張ったつもりだったんだけどねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700104/7007001040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華……その……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもまぁ、くよくよしてても仕方ないよね！\r\n次行こう、次！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700104/7007001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ガンガンレッスン頑張って、また違う形で結果出す！\r\nプロデューサーとなら、無理じゃないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700104/7007001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今回の失敗をバネに成長する予定の三峰と、\r\nそんな三峰を全力で支えてくれるはずのプロデューサー",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700104/7007001040040",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふたりなら大抵のことはなんとかできるって\r\n思ってるんだけど──違う？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700104/7007001040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──結華らしいな、しっかりしてる\r\n違わないよ。また一緒に頑張ろう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001040060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いい返事だよ、プロデューサー！\r\nまだまだ三峰と頑張ってもらわなきゃだからね！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
